        "accuracy": 0.7021,
        "violation_recall": 0.3529,
        "compliant_recall": 0.9,
        "passes_individual_judge_thresholds": false
      }
    },
    "conclusion": "no surface feature reaches the individual judge thresholds of 85 percent accuracy with 80 percent recall in both directions. Size remains a partial cue and this bounds it rather than removing it: a judge passing the 92 percent panel threshold is using more than size."
  },
